<title>USA: Rainforest files for 2.5 mln share offer.</title>
<headline>Rainforest files for 2.5 mln share offer.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1996-08-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Rainforest Cafe Inc said on Tuesday that it filed for a proposed public offering of 2.5 million shares of common stock.</p>
<p>Of the total, 2.3 million would be from the company and 200,000 from selling shareholders.</p>
</text>
